1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,000
This is the happiest night of my life!

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
And it shall only grow brighter, my love.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,000
You celebrate too soon, Lady Elara.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Who are you? How dare you come here uninvited!

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
I was invited... by your beloved Marcus himself.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Liar! You swore an oath to me. You betrayed everything we built!

7
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Marcus, what is he talking about? What oath?

8
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
He hid a wife. She is alive.
